{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02345","headline":"杂歌谣辞 中山孺子妾歌 · 李白","name":"杂歌谣辞 中山孺子妾歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"中山孺子妾，特以色见珍。\n虽不如延年妹，亦是当时绝世人。\n桃李出深井，花艳惊上春。\n一贵复一贱，关天岂由身。\n芙蓉老秋霜，团扇羞网尘。\n戚姬髡翦入舂市，万古共悲辛。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02345.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02345","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}